      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-200 leading-relaxed font-normal">
        Accelerating Docker Buildx in GitHub Actions relies on dual caching backends: GitHub Actions Cache (type=gha) for ephemeral PR workflows and Docker Registry Cache (type=registry) for persistent multi-branch builds. By pairing cache-from and cache-to with mode=max, teams eliminate redundant layer recompilation, reducing build times from 9.5 minutes to 42 seconds.
      </p>
