        </h2>
        <p>
          Below is the complete production workflow utilizing <code class="text-cyan-300 font-mono">docker/setup-buildx-action</code> and <code class="text-cyan-300 font-mono">docker/build-push-action</code>. It implements a multi-tier caching architecture: it attempts to load from the current branch GHA cache, falls back to the main branch GHA cache, and writes out fresh layers with <code class="text-emerald-400 font-mono">mode=max</code>.
        </p>

        <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 p-5 font-mono text-xs text-slate-300 overflow-x-auto shadow-2xl my-6">
